{"id":14,"date":"2012-01-11T01:15:48","date_gmt":"2012-01-11T01:15:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/agilewriter.wordpress.com\/?page_id=2"},"modified":"2026-02-05T22:28:41","modified_gmt":"2026-02-05T22:28:41","slug":"about","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/about\/","title":{"rendered":"About Greg"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/greg-smith.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-29 size-thumbnail\" src=\"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/greg-circle-300x300-1-150x150.png\" alt=\"greg-circle-300x300\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/greg-circle-300x300-1-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/greg-circle-300x300-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/greg-circle-300x300-1.png 574w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/Greg-Smith.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Greg Smith<\/a> founded The Agile Writer Workshop in 2011 with the mission of finding a new approach to helping beginning writers complete a first-draft novel in 6 months. Greg created &#8220;The Agile Writer Method&#8221; based upon the writings of experts in mythology, screenwriting, psychology and a little project management.<\/p>\n<p>His seminars on the Agile Writer Method have informed and delighted hundreds of writers, scholars, and university students. Since 2011, Agile Writer authors have completed over 50 first draft novels, and over a dozen published works.<\/p>\n<p>Greg has written several books including <a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/gp\/product\/B010TB0FI6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reel Heroes<\/a> (a movie review book that focuses on the hero in the story) and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.amazon.com\/Agile-Writer-Method-Write-Months\/dp\/1941526098\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agile Writer: Method<\/a> which are available on Amazon.com.<\/p>\n<p><em>&#8220;You don\u2019t have to be a great gram\u00admar\u00adian or great speller to write a novel. You don\u2019t have to have con\u00adnec\u00adtions in the writ\u00ading world. What you need to have is a pas\u00adsion for your story idea and a plan to com\u00adplete. You bring the pas\u00adsion, we\u2019ll help you with the plan.&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n<p>-Greg Smith (2011)<br \/>\nFounder Agile Writers<br \/>\nCreator of the Agile Writer Method<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Greg Smith founded The Agile Writer Workshop in 2011 with the mission of finding a new approach to helping beginning writers complete a first-draft novel in 6 months. Greg created &#8220;The Agile Writer Method&#8221; based upon the writings of experts in mythology, screenwriting, psychology and a little project management. His seminars on the Agile Writer Method have informed and delighted [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":785,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-14","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=14"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1153,"href":"https:\/\/agilewriters.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14\/revisions\/1153"}],"wp:f